e cash, you can buy better buildings, purchase more land, and hold more ore on your plot at one time.\n\n📱💻🎮 You will be able to play on any device, on release. (MOBILE, PC, CONSOLE)\n\n⭐ Please consider liking and favoriting the game for more updates.\n\n👑 Premium Benefits\n- Hard Hat Dropper\n- Builder's Club Upgrader\n\n🏝️ Private Server Benefits\n- Tropical Cell Furnace\n\nDevelopment for this game began on 3/23/2025","path":"/game/119296091834097-drillbit-and-co","slug":"119296091834097-drillbit-and-co","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/287611239b45906923f90e6cc965ed02985d49a6bbc9cd25743322ec929eb5d6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a1ecc5067e50333bf7ec3e469110bcf5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2085944,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-08T15:23:35.744Z","creator":{"name":"Derp LLC","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":118208351169540,"name":"[ Content Deleted ]","desc":"","path":"/game/118208351169540-content-deleted","slug":"118208351169540-content-deleted","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14119,"totalPages":589,"currentPage":401}